{"3675340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Killing Things With Your Friends", "steam_appid": 3675340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing Things With Your Friends is a co-op meat-grinder built around creative dismemberment. Tear off mutant limbs and use their abilities to survive the gauntlet of deadly lab experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, impress the researchers, and you might leave rich.<br>Fail and you might just become the next mutant experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO EXOGEN LABS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your team, sign the waiver you definitely read the fine print for, and enter our test chambers filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant ‘Things’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the trials and escape before the timer expires, or you might just expire with it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BODY PARTS ARE WEAPONS AND TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip them off, throw them away, and pick up something fresher from the bloodied floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise your arsenal from whatever still twitches nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=852 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different limbs to gain the upper hand in fast-paced combat, and when you run low, harvest some more from your foes… or friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO TRIAL IS EVER THE SAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials are designed to test communication and coordination.<br>Survival requires teamwork! Layouts will shift, Test Subjects get stronger, and puzzles are ever-evolving.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll share weapons, tactics, and mutant body parts, with dozens of unique challenge rooms to complete in our procedurally generated trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes lending a hand might cost you an arm (and a leg).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=852 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE, ADAPT AND EARN GOLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, why else would you sign the waiver?<br>Complete small challenges to unlock upgrades and spend your gold on new limbs, buffs, cosmetics, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance toward becoming the perfect specimen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLING THINGS IS BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to three other Test Subjects to survive the chaos of Exogen’s labs in public or private lobbies, or face the mutants alone if you seek a mindless slaughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United you stand.<br>Divided… you still stand, just on fewer legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥳 1–4 player online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Vast array of unique challenge rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 Dismember your enemies &amp; each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦵 Numerous mutant weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Procedurally generated trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤡 Character cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Original soundtrack from Jeremy Cullen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/555aff3081f9a1417d2c127a58188373.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=852 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/555aff3081f9a1417d2c127a58188373.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/555aff3081f9a1417d2c127a58188373.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing Things With Your Friends is a co-op meat-grinder built around creative dismemberment. Tear off mutant limbs and use their abilities to survive the gauntlet of deadly lab experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, impress the researchers, and you might leave rich.<br>Fail and you might just become the next mutant experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/09b9d65080683e5408a9801d9cc4aecc.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO EXOGEN LABS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your team, sign the waiver you definitely read the fine print for, and enter our test chambers filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant ‘Things’.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the trials and escape before the timer expires, or you might just expire with it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/eec999ae669479a8be81152e0ce80065.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BODY PARTS ARE WEAPONS AND TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip them off, throw them away, and pick up something fresher from the bloodied floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise your arsenal from whatever still twitches nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=852 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/f15d866eb19124aaadd7358fef9af12b.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different limbs to gain the upper hand in fast-paced combat, and when you run low, harvest some more from your foes… or friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/e494533aed58b6153dfaec53af7bee0a.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO TRIAL IS EVER THE SAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trials are designed to test communication and coordination.<br>Survival requires teamwork! Layouts will shift, Test Subjects get stronger, and puzzles are ever-evolving.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll share weapons, tactics, and mutant body parts, with dozens of unique challenge rooms to complete in our procedurally generated trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes lending a hand might cost you an arm (and a leg).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=852 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/82408a1c1bf29c1f9272a14db0581652.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE, ADAPT AND EARN GOLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, why else would you sign the waiver?<br>Complete small challenges to unlock upgrades and spend your gold on new limbs, buffs, cosmetics, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance toward becoming the perfect specimen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a3ef1b2011ea9cd531953ba93ce770bd.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILLING THINGS IS BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to three other Test Subjects to survive the chaos of Exogen’s labs in public or private lobbies, or face the mutants alone if you seek a mindless slaughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United you stand.<br>Divided… you still stand, just on fewer legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/13dfc7dafb22d8c6863822e24b06bef7.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.poster.avif?t=1788242962\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.webm?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/a7f5b4c222e71efdcfe11603e71a1fb6.mp4?t=1788242962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥳 1–4 player online co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Vast array of unique challenge rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🩸 Dismember your enemies &amp; each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦵 Numerous mutant weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Procedurally generated t